Here's the code that enables dual screen on my Model 76, hope it helps.
(it's overly complex since I often clone my disk and use it for other
systems that may or may not have SPX hardware in it)

-$ 	if f$getdvi("GCA0:","EXISTS") then goto gc_present
$ 	run sys$system:sysgen 
	connect gca0/adap=0/csr=%X5000/vect=%o400/numv=01/driver=gcbdriver
$gc_present:
$!
$ 	If F$Getdvi("GEA0:","Exists") Then Device1="GEA0"
$ 	If F$Getdvi("GAB0:","Exists") Then Device1="GAA0"
$!
$ 	DECW$DEVICE == "''Device1',GCA0"
$! 	DECW$COLOR == "F,F"
$!
$	exit
